# Form Input Standards

All Vuetify input components must use **compact density** and **hide-details="auto"**.

## Required Props

| Prop | Value |
|------|-------|
| `density` | `"compact"` |
| `hide-details` | `"auto"` |
| `variant` | `"outlined"` |
| `autocomplete` | `"off"` on every non-auth text field |

## Exceptions

- Login/register may use `density="comfortable"` for accessibility
- Auth forms use `autocomplete="username"`, `"current-password"`, or `"new-password"`

## Duration Fields

Durations are stored in milliseconds. Always label the unit explicitly — `Dwell time (seconds)`, not `Dwell time`.

```vue
<!-- ✅ GOOD -->
<v-text-field
  variant="outlined"
  density="compact"
  hide-details="auto"
  autocomplete="off"
/>

<!-- ❌ BAD -->
<v-text-field density="comfortable" ... />
<v-text-field />  <!-- missing hide-details -->
```
